<title>USA: Brazil coffee areas seen free of damaging cold.</title>
<headline>Brazil coffee areas seen free of damaging cold.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>No damaging cold is in sight for the next five days in Brazil's coffee regions, independent forecaster Weather Services Corporation said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Low temperatures are seen at 50-64 degrees through to Thursday, with mild weather expected on Friday and Saturday.</p>
